{
  "id": "sm-knowledge-graph-service",
  "title": "Connect a Synthetic Monitoring check to its service",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Connect an existing check to a service discovered by Knowledge Graph."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Open your check list to choose an existing check."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "open-the-starting-page",
      "title": "Choose a check",
      "requirements": [],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks",
          "content": "Open **Checks** to choose the check that monitors your service.",
          "tooltip": "Start with the check whose results you want to connect to service context.",
          "requirements": [],
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true,
          "verify": "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks"
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "main a[href^='/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/'][href$='/edit']:nth-match(1)",
          "content": "Open the first check for editing.",
          "tooltip": "Open the first check in the list.",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks"
          ],
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "button",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='checkEditor navigation labels']",
          "content": "Open **Labels** to review the check’s service connection.",
          "tooltip": "Review the labels used to connect this check to service context.",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks"
          ],
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "The check’s labels hold its service connection."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Connect the check to its service, then inspect the relationship in its results."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "connect-a-synthetic-monitoring-check-to",
      "title": "Connect your service",
      "requirements": [],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "conditional",
          "id": "service-setup-page",
          "conditions": [
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='checkEditor navigation labels'][aria-selected='true']",
          "whenTrue": [
            {
              "type": "conditional",
              "id": "service-fields-open",
              "conditions": [
                "exists-reftarget"
              ],
              "reftarget": "[data-testid='knowledgeGraph service-name']",
              "whenTrue": [
                {
                  "type": "markdown",
                  "content": "Review the service connection below."
                }
              ],
              "whenFalse": [
                {
                  "type": "interactive",
                  "id": "add-service-connection",
                  "content": "Add a service: choose **Add connection → Service**.",
                  "requirements": [
                    "exists-reftarget",
                    "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks"
                  ],
                  "action": "highlight",
                  "reftarget": "[data-testid='knowledgeGraph add-connection']",
                  "doIt": false,
                  "showMe": true,
                  "tooltip": "Choose the service connection type."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "whenFalse": [
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "Open **Labels** to add or review the service connection."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='knowledgeGraph service-name'][value]:not([value=''])",
          "content": "Choose the service this check monitors in **Service name** to continue.",
          "tooltip": "Match the service actually monitored by this check and preserve an existing correct value.",
          "requirements": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks"
          ],
          "doIt": false,
          "showMe": false,
          "objectives": [
            "exists-reftarget"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "conditional",
          "id": "service-selected",
          "conditions": [
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='knowledgeGraph service-name'][value]:not([value=''])",
          "whenTrue": [
            {
              "type": "interactive",
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "[data-testid='knowledgeGraph namespace']",
              "content": "Choose the matching **Namespace**. Keep **Any namespace** only if the connection should span namespaces.",
              "tooltip": "Match the namespace to distinguish this service from services with the same name elsewhere.",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks"
              ],
              "doIt": false,
              "showMe": true
            },
            {
              "type": "interactive",
              "action": "button",
              "reftarget": "[data-testid='checkEditor form submit']",
              "content": "Save the connection. Skip this step if you kept the existing values.",
              "tooltip": "Persist the reviewed values while keeping unrelated labels intact.",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks"
              ],
              "doIt": true,
              "showMe": true,
              "skippable": true
            }
          ],
          "whenFalse": [
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "If no services are listed, check your Knowledge Graph integration before continuing."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid=\"connected-services-section\"]",
          "content": "Inspect **Connected entities** for the service and namespace you saved. Allow a few minutes, then refresh if needed.",
          "tooltip": "Confirm that the displayed relationship matches the service this check monitors.",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks"
          ],
          "doIt": false,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "type": "conditional",
          "id": "graph-is-empty",
          "conditions": [
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='connected-services-section']:contains('No graph data found')",
          "whenTrue": [
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "The relationship may take a few minutes to appear. If it stays empty, check your Knowledge Graph integration."
            }
          ],
          "whenFalse": [
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "Check that the graph shows the intended service and namespace."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "autoCollapse": false
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "A saved connection identifies the service; **Connected entities** shows whether Knowledge Graph has discovered the relationship."
    }
  ]
}
